  // (9.07 … 9.57 m), the fast lane of pale concrete (9.59 … 12.76 m), a white line, a white platform, the wall – and the
  // track right behind it. The lane's lines are NOT parallel to the door line: the red line and the fast lane lie 0.5 m
  // further out at the lane's north end than at its south end, and the wall comes 0.9 m nearer the doors (15.06 → 14.18 m).
